AMD BiGym 3DGS ROCm Reproduction Kit

This repository contains original data-acquisition gates, reconstruction,
orchestration, validation, and documentation, plus patches derived from BiGym
and gsplat source code.

BiGym is licensed under Apache-2.0. Its upstream project is:
https://github.com/NeuracoreAI/bigym

gsplat is distributed under its upstream license. Its upstream project is:
https://github.com/nerfstudio-project/gsplat

The included configuration and evidence refer to a shell reconstructed from
DL3DV-10K. DL3DV-derived PLY files and original images/videos are intentionally
not included. The modified research-result contact sheets in docs/images are
separately marked CC BY-NC 4.0 plus the DL3DV Terms of Use. Review
docs/data-license.md before acquiring or distributing data.

The license-free synthetic room generated by
reconstruction/src/make_synthetic_fixture.py is original project test data and
is covered by the repository Apache-2.0 license.
